Z||000000||Bluemagic||03-31-2001||01:29 AM||||I am in the second weekend of my conversion and will be for quite awhile as a matter of fact I plan to debut the car at next years Daytona,while I am at it I intend to  put a Nos kit on the motor this will be used only for a quick surprise use and will be adjustable from 75 -150 HP plus the power from the engine some where in the vicinity of 345+ HP.All will be controlled by a Jacobs Nitrous controller so I wont get too happy with the button.I have a 85 SE and need to change the nose also a fast back conversion so I will get back to work and will keep everyone posted as to the progress.||||reg||3
