Z||000004||bubbajoexx||03-31-2001||02:15 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Bluemagic:<BR><B>I am in the second weekend of my conversion and will be for quite awhile as a matter of fact I plan to debut the car at next years Daytona,while I am at it I intend to  put a Nos kit on the motor this will be used only for a quick surprise use and will be adjustable from 75 -150 HP plus the power from the engine some where in the vicinity of 345+ HP.All will be controlled by a Jacobs Nitrous controller so I wont get too happy with the button.I have a 85 SE and need to change the nose also a fast back conversion so I will get back to work and will keep everyone posted as to the progress.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>use a turbo with 6 lbs boost or you will be putting head gaskets on every time you hit the nos button 4.x engines head gaskets will not hold up to the nitros punch <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Dcp_0001x.jpg"> <BR>this car is a 4.9 with carb 4:11 gears 4spd<BR>custom dist. pulls wheel stands in second gear rolling in with a power shift from 1st to second . <p>[This message has been edited by bubbajoexx (edited 03-31-2001).]||||reg||9
