Z||000007||bubbajoexx||03-31-2001||06:56 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Bluemagic:<BR><B>What kind of carb and distributor are you using on the 4.9 also do you usea adaptor plate for the carb?.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>600 cfm rochester the dist is custom made by me using olds guts and Caddy shell with a custom ignition curve this thing makes unreal power and torque and insantaniosu throttle resonce  Bubbajoexx ps I also make my own carb adaptor<p>[This message has been edited by bubbajoexx (edited 03-31-2001).]||||reg||1
